#: ../content/index.rst:27
msgid "For each combination of interface (agent, customer, public) and language a side bar can be defined in the new side-bar settings screen in the FAQ. Accessing FAQZoom without a specific article selected, will default to the \"default article\" set in the same setting. When writing new FAQ articles, using the format \"#SomeWord\" will show a selection of FAQ articles which can be linked to."
msgstr ""

